node CONFIG 51.694 45.206 4.6345 2.4242 "PipelineConfig\l\l• JSON / GUI\l" rounded,filled ellipse #4a6fa5 #e8eef7
node P1 25.486 39.799 12.038 2.9954 "Stage 1: Resolution adjust\l\l• Compare input µm/px to model's training µm/px\l• Skip if ratio is inside tolerance band\l• \
Otherwise rescale image toward target µm/px\l• Geometry is inverse-rescaled after Stage 2 (identifyFeatures)\l" rounded,filled box #3c8c4f #e6f4ea
node P2 14.583 39.799 8.5479 3.0788 "Stage 2: Wing isolation (optional)\l\l• Run wing-isolation model → wing polygon\l• Buffer polygon by wing_expand_fraction\l• \
Mask non-wing pixels to 0\l• Write isolated image + wing.geojson\l" rounded,filled box #3c8c4f #e6f4ea
node P3 23.722 34.954 7.1208 3.5058 "Stage 3: Landmark detection\l\l• Load LandmarkPredictor (cached)\l• Heatmap regression inference\l• Extract peak coordinates\l• \
Map names → GeoJSON schema\l• Write landmarks.geojson\l" rounded,filled box #3c8c4f #e6f4ea
node P4 14.917 34.954 9.8708 3.4225 "Stage 4: Hinge chop\l\l• Load landmarks from Stage 3\l• Build hinge polyline from distal-margin landmarks\l• Build proximal \
mask\l• Black out hinge pixels (in place, no translation)\l• Write chopped image (temp)\l" rounded,filled box #3c8c4f #e6f4ea
node P5 45.667 34.954 11.183 5.2975 "Stage 5: Segmentation\l\l• Load seg model + metadata (cached)\l• Read RGB uint8\l• Tiled inference w/ center-crop stitch\l• \
Optional ROI from wing.geojson (skips background tiles)\l• Per-channel normalization\l• Gaussian smooth probabilities\l• Argmax \
→ class mask\l• Polygonize mask → features\l• Save detection.geojson\l" rounded,filled box #3c8c4f #e6f4ea
node P6 33.681 34.954 12.173 3.5058 "Stage 6: Wing rotation (optional)\l\l• Fit affine from reliable landmarks\l• Rotate un-masked image to canonical orientation\l• \
Apply same affine to every produced GeoJSON (in-place)\l• Optional mirror-correct for opposite-chirality wings\l• → rotated \
GeoJSONs feed identifyFeatures + overlay renders\l" rounded,filled box #3c8c4f #e6f4ea
